      "id": "claim_c361381a0534418d822fb56bbba3f7e5",
      "statement": "The Fedwire Funds Connector (FFC, SYS-PNG-FFC) is the Fedwire-facing module of the Payment Network Gateway (PNG), built and operated by Payment Networks Engineering (PNE) under Director Raj Malhotra, with Chen Wei as Fedwire technical owner and Brian Walsh as engineering manager; support is provided by PNE on-call (T1) and #payment-networks.",
      "evidence": [
        {
