        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_458354e0cdad43ad833230f145d4d90f",
      "statement": "FFC connects to the Federal Reserve's Fedwire Funds Service over FedLine Direct using dual MQ channels, with Columbus as primary and Charlotte as contingency; FedLine Advantage serves as a separate business-continuity path.",
