      "id": "claim_9b0f426f176c4a968b38ab5333d77c28",
      "statement": "Effective 2026-10-01, per CNB-MEMO-2026-09, the Swift Alliance Gateway/gpi Connector (SYS-PNG-GPI), the Swift API gateway (Microgateway) and SwiftNet PKI service accounts, and the international wire tracking roadmap moved from Payment Networks Engineering to Global Transaction Services Integration (GTSI), while the Fedwire Funds Connector (SYS-PNG-FFC), including net.fedwire.ack.v1 and net.fedwire.inbound.v1, explicitly remained with Payment Networks Engineering under Raj Malhotra (Brian Walsh, EM).",
      "evidence": [
        {
